  "setup_notes": "本文件为Part 1(剧本卡heart_of_the_elders 04205；act/agenda在pillars_of_judgment遭遇组)。mouth_of_kn_yan以The Cavern's Maw面朝上入场；战役日志中每已知一条路径放1个pillar标记。探索牌堆=6张单面丛林地点(path_of_thorns/river_canyon/rope_bridge/serpents_haven/circuitous_trail/time_wracked_woods)+pitfall/ants/lost_in_the_wilds/low_on_supplies各1张；再从overgrown_ruins/temple_of_the_fang/stone_altar中随机选1张洗入探索牌堆(若已mapped the way forward则改为直接入场)，其余2张移出游戏。共用的rainforest地点卡上黄色圆盘图标在本剧本对应time_wracked_woods，深绿等号图标对应mouth_of_kn_yan，紫色沙漏图标对应stone_altar。Act2(opening_the_maw)推进后翻入Part 2(knyan遭遇组)。"
